    "detailed_description": "How about a rematch?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry new top experiences together with this new action game, called Fight &amp; Crush! Being in the shoes of a beginner fighter, your main mission is to beat all the world fighters in your upcoming fights! You will have a limited time for this and limited health, so take care! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nArm with courage! The moment of the big chance has come, don\u2019t miss it. Study and analyze the enemies carefully because each of them is preparing a surprise for you. Everyone is waiting to see a new invincible fighter. But what surprise are you preparing for the others? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- Training/Arcade Mode<br />\r\n- 20 characters<br />\r\n- Multiple fights",
